{"server":"tw","storyId":"act10d5_level_act10d5_st04","groupId":"act10d5","stageId":null,"title":"表裡不一","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act10d5/level_act10d5_st04.txt","sourceHash":"54387f3e7b7c9a1fdb107201bf06716c627d0a97eb97268b25ba43d64d927be8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"早露 赎罪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這稍微有些生澀的口感，這好像放多了鹽的味道，啊，回家的感覺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不就是出了一次長任務，你至於嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你是不知道，烏薩斯的食物我實在是吃不慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還是羅德島的食堂好，全是我喜歡吃的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"從你剛才的感慨來看，我可聽不出這是你喜歡吃的東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好吃和喜歡吃又不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我還被一些找到親戚的難民請去吃了大餐呢，嘖嘖，那叫一個精緻典雅高貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我還是覺得不習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，以後你就叫被羅德島食堂馴服的男人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以這次任務怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很簡單啊，你又不是不知道，把我們從切爾諾伯格救出來的難民送去其他的烏薩斯城市。就是跑跑腿，只是比較花時間而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當我沒問，你這傢伙，聽到能幫難民就變得特別拼命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，雖然時間和人數都不允許我們做很多事，但救一個是一個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也聽杜賓說了我們現在的處境不好和烏薩斯有什麼接觸，所以阿米婭和博士願意做這樣的救援我就已經很高興了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我們這邊也為有這樣的領袖高興。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這件事上，除了阿米婭和博士，還要特別感謝一個人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噢，我知道我知道，路上的時候聽其他人說了，好像是一個叫娜塔莉婭的女孩是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她可是我們這裡的大明星呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我好像聽到有人在談論我的樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"後勤幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，娜塔莉婭，中午好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"塞倫先生，午安。還有這位是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛幹員","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我代號叫圓規，叫我圓規就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"圓規......是個好代號呢，午安。不介意的話，我能坐在這裡吃飯嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我聽說只是個學生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是一眼就看得出是個超級大小姐嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"又不衝突！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我完全不知道該怎麼跟這樣的人說話啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"別緊張，娜塔莉婭很好說話的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，聽兩位剛才說的話，圓規先生是剛剛完成護送難民的任務回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我們剛才還在聊這個呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對對，我正打算跟他說娜塔莉婭你在這件事裡起的作用呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是做了一些微不足道的工作而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你太謙虛了，如果不是娜塔莉婭你主動去遊說那些難民，我們的工作絕對不會進展得這麼順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"我在路上也聽難民們說過，說是有一個特別好心和善良的小姐告訴他們羅德島都是好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，聽塞倫這麼說，我也得好好感謝你了，娜塔莉婭小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"老實說，一些難民對我們的態度也好不到哪裡去，沒有你的話，我完全可以想像路上會有多少不愉快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我自己也是難民出身，完全可以理解他們，但我也不想做好事還遭白眼啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都是我應該做的，真正辛苦的是圓規先生你們護送的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"大家不是不相信羅德島，只是他們剛剛蒙受了災難，對誰都沒有辦法很好信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是感覺到羅德島確實是為大家好，而且我以前作為學生會長最常做的就是這樣的事，這些都是我擅長的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，塞倫，你聽聽，這才叫人話，聽了讓人舒坦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛才就跟你說了，娜塔莉婭很好說話的好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始聽說新人過去是貴族大小姐時我們還有點擔心不好相處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"結果來了之後發現，工作能力又強，又很好說話，跟誰都能打好關係，每個人都喜歡她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事，只是我年紀還小，大家都願意照顧我而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說起來，娜塔莉婭小姐已經決定留在羅德島了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，上個星期我已經通過了後勤部門的考核，正式成為了羅德島的員工之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，那太好了，相信我，你一定會喜歡上這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經有些喜歡上這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，塞倫先生，第二批難民的名單和他們需要被送往的目的地我也已經準備好了，午休結束後就麻煩你推進下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？這麼快嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，救出來的難民們實質上已經全部有了去處了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，除了還有一部分在接受治療的之外，其他已經全部確認完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"厲害厲害，部長把這件事交給你負責果然是正確的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是做了我該做的事而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，我也得趕緊去申請參加第二批的護送了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"第二批你也要去？你不是吃不慣烏薩斯的飯菜嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"但我看到他們回到自己熟悉的地方，找到親戚的表情就很開心啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圓規","speakerId":"char_013_riop","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不說了，飯也吃差不多了，幫我倒一下，我先去申請了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我才不要幫你倒飯啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，不好意思啊，娜塔莉婭，讓你見笑了，他就是這樣急匆匆的性格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"圓規先生對難民是有一些執著......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對，你剛才也聽到了，他過去也是難民，是被我們一支小隊救的，所以每次遇到和難民有關的任務他就特別拼命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位關係很好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是啊，算不錯吧。他一開始也在後勤待了一段時間，後來才轉去前線的，算是同期，性格也挺合得來，不知不覺就成了好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得娜塔莉婭你也是那個自治團的一員吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，不過索......凜冬她們和圓規先生一樣是前線幹員，而我留在了後勤部而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說你們是一起被發現的，你們的關係也很好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，是的，那段時光我們一直在一起，關係很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"共患難啊，那很好，啊，別誤會，我不是說災難好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是凜冬嗎，真巧，我們剛提到她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，她是不是在看你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，塞倫先生，我先離開一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員塞倫","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬，你找我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事吧，你的臉色很差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，我一定是瘋了才會想著來找你，當我沒來過吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，等等。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"別拉我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"來聊聊吧，索尼婭。自從來到這裡，我們還沒有好好聊過呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"來我的房間吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"請坐，要喝點什麼嗎？咖啡，紅茶，我都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......不愧是貴族大小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"還有力氣諷刺我，看起來你比我想像的要正常一點呢，你剛才的臉色很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那就喝咖啡吧，羅德島上賣的咖啡味道還不錯哦，不過紅茶就相當一般了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"理由據說是因為總工程師小姐對咖啡有特別的執著。你覺得呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，最近聽到的都是讚美之詞，我都有些懷念你對我的這種充滿攻擊性的態度了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你還是這麼討人厭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你要糖嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎，我泡的是黑咖啡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"請用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是被苦到了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我來幫你加一勺糖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你把我拉過來就是為了捉弄我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不要糖的可是你，索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而且不要忘了，先來找我的，也是你哦，索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......我說過了，沒有什麼要和你說的，我們不是朋友，我也不喜歡你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我和你也好，和安娜也好，都算不上朋友呢，我們只是一起從那裡活了下來而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭，有些話，越是親近的人，越是無法訴說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是我的朋友，我是不會拉你過來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"有些話，只有對方不那麼重要，而又明白你的處境時，才是最方便傾訴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"對我來說，這個人最好是安娜，是你也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......羅莎琳性格太直接了，不行，拉達太善良，也不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而對你來說也是一樣的，這個角色恐怕只有我了，所以對於你來找我，我倒是也沒有那麼意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說，你想和我說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......索尼婭，這兩個月，你作為幹員戰鬥下來的感覺怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼叫怎麼樣，戰鬥，就是戰鬥。除了要聽那個博士的指揮有點煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你連博士都敢頂撞的事連在後勤部的我都有所耳聞哦，真有你的風格呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不像你，我不會說漂亮話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我是想問，在經歷了那樣的事情後，拿起武器真的不會讓你感覺難受嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......我喜歡戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此......話說回來，我還是建議你學一些所謂的漂亮話比較好哦，不然會吃虧的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們確實不是朋友關係，不過畢竟也算是同甘共苦的夥伴呢，關心夥伴是很正常的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而且老實說，我還是很喜歡你，想和你成為朋友的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不，確切地說，是羡慕你吧。因為你能輕易做到我做不到的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，索尼婭，真的不能告訴我你為什麼來找我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......我最近一直在做噩夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"可以告訴我噩夢的內容嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......不能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，不過我猜，那一定包含不能對安娜說的東西吧？不然你肯定不會來找我的，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"其實還在切爾諾伯格的時候我就已經有這種感覺了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你們做事很有默契，你們知道對方想要什麼，但是，你們卻似乎在避免和對方交流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你管。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我並不是想開導你。我現在不認為自己有任何可以引導別人的資格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"換個話題吧，索尼婭，你打算以凜冬的身份活下去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，你打算一直待在羅德島嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是可以不留在羅德島的。這裡的大人真的人很好，如果我們想要離開，是可以去安穩的地方生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"和我們一起被救出來的人，已經有不少已經在返回烏薩斯的路上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們想，我們也可以去烏薩斯的另一座城市，在那裡開始我們的新生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼沒有走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"今天天氣真不錯啊，索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是個適合野餐的好天氣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"當我們在廢墟中狼狽地尋找食物，一瓶純淨水都要省著用一天的時候，我就經常在想："},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"要是活下來，我一定要在一個陽光明媚的下午，找一座美麗的花園，在那裡吃個夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但我想的更多的是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那一天你殺了我就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不要猶豫，不要動惻隱之心，不要覺得我還有救，將我當成可惡的貴族的一員，揮下你手中的斧頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我就這麼死在那裡，對我來說說不定是最好的呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以現在送你上路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經離開那裡了，索尼婭，我們回到了文明社會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我們要用文明的思路去思考，要用文明的方法去做事，很多在那裡發生的事就無法再發生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我才不管這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你管的。你是個善良的人，索尼婭，“冬將軍”，弱者的保護神，霸凌者的剋星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼東西，別說得這麼噁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我聽到的傳聞中的你哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，我只是看不慣那些人而已，仗著自己有點力氣就欺負別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你一定很討厭貴族吧，索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，一群虛偽的傢伙，總是自以為高人一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，他們，不，我們，總是自以為高人一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"被你帶回去之後，我應該沒有對你們說過具體在那之前，我經歷了什麼吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我只知道你是那個貴族團體的首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你有時間的話，聽我說一說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分貴族和有錢人事實上在整合運動開始佔領城市時，甚至在那之前，就已經開始逃難了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"貴族們早就知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，貴族們早就知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......真卑鄙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，但你知道的，貴族都是自私的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你怎麼還會在那。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"很簡單，我們家逃得還是太慢了，和另外一些貴族一起被攔了下來。當然，也有一些家族是沒有把這件事放在心上吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不要露出這麼不耐煩的表情，這是必要的背景介紹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，被轉移到那所學校裡的貴族學生們，基本上就是這兩類貴族的子女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我們應當和父母關在一起，然後被整合運動作為籌碼向烏薩斯交換什麼的，但最終卻變成我們被迫和父母分開來到這所學校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這很奇怪嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪哦，貴族在戰爭時是一種可以交換的籌碼，是不應該這麼浪費的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"貴族是優雅的，高貴的，應當被尊重其身份的，即使成為俘虜也不應忘記自己的家族和身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你們貴族腦子都有什麼毛病吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是以前的我，會因為你這句話而跟你辯論至少兩個小時哦，索尼婭，因為我就是這麼被教育的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我現在同意你的意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"揭開光鮮的外表，貴族和平民明明沒有區別，而有了這層光鮮的外表，貴族們反而變得醜陋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記得吧，我們討論過，如果沒有第一場大火燒掉第一個糧食點，事情不會變得那麼糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"但她也說過，她覺得沒有那場大火，或許也會發生類似的事讓一切都無法挽回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是我，經歷了這樣的事也會這麼想呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但無論如何，這都是在說——【需要發生什麼才會導致後來的一切】。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而可笑的是，貴族不需要發生什麼，他們光是被聚集在一起，就會發生爭鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你想聽新舊貴族的差別，市長的政治傾向，以及市內的貴族分成幾個派別嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼要聽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"因為不聽你就無法理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那你還是別說了，我不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我也不感興趣，只不過作為羅斯托夫家的長女，我必須瞭解這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你只需要知道，在被聚集到學校裡的第一天，貴族學生們之間就差點爆發流血事件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"然後我不得不作為第四中學的學生會長站出來，用我的威信將他們組織起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你是說你是為了不讓他們內鬥而把他們組織起來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，聽起來是不是很正當？為了不讓自己的同學內鬥，我站了出來，把他們組織了起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_schoolyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"維克多","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼古拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帕維爾，別以為你的父親掌握著一條礦脈開採權就可以為所欲為！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"區區男爵也敢對我放肆，沒被我一劍刺死是他走運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至於你，伊萬諾夫家的老二，什麼時候輪到你說話了，要不要我也給你的胸口開個洞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼古拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你......我的父親是議員，你怎麼敢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"議員？你知道有多少議員會在每個周日來參加我母親舉辦的聚會嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你不知道，因為你的父親根本不夠格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼古拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"住口，帕維爾同學！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭，你可以叫我帕沙，我們之間不需要這麼見外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我是認真的，帕維爾·尼古拉耶維奇！不要在這個時候掀起無謂的鬥爭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如您所願，我尊敬的學生會長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"塔吉揚娜，麻煩你包紮一下維克多同學的傷口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔吉揚娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是、是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，我們現在被關在了這所學校裡，我們還不知道會發生什麼，但至少，我想那些整合運動不會輕易把我們放走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"瞧瞧你們的樣子，才來到這裡半天，就開始爭吵，打鬥，甚至想要殺害另一個貴族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一名貴族應有的樣子嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你又是誰，我憑什麼聽你的話？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔吉揚娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"憑她是鮑里斯第四中學的學生會長，娜塔莉婭·安德列耶維娜·羅斯托娃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安東","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你、你就是羅斯托夫伯爵的長女？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安德列","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她就是那個“第四中學的明珠”，羅斯托夫伯爵公開表示會讓她繼承爵位的娜塔莉婭·安德列耶維娜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡聚集了來自各區的中學的貴族，我並不想強調自己的身份，我只想說，我們現在面臨的是生存問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡除了我們，還有許多平民學校的學生，我想各位也並不希望讓平民們看到自己的醜態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我們雖然被整合運動扣留了下來，但是他們如果是想要向烏薩斯要求什麼，肯定是不敢輕易傷害我們的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"難道我們要將自己寶貴的生命浪費在內鬥中嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"比起爭執，我們現在更需要的是團結！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，現在我們已經知道，整合運動根本沒有把我們這些貴族放在眼裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不說這個。雖然我平息了爭執，但是光靠口號和威信，在那種情況下其實是很難有很大效果的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭，你知道烏薩斯為什麼會有今天的強大嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，最後也有許多貴族學生不願意接受服從我或者和某人共處而離開，並自己組團。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但最終，我至少將三十多個人聚集在了一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"當時的我，認為我已經做得非常好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪除了你們這個團體還有許多落單的貴族雜碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她們應該也組織起了各種各樣的團體吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼可能知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，雖然和你聊天也很有意思，但在這種話題上，果然還是和安娜聊會更好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":".....別轉移話題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，抱歉抱歉，雖然是我想要說，但真要說出口果然還是有些艱難呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯之所以能走到今天，是因為戰爭，上一任國王陛下不斷地發動戰爭，獲取資源，然後投入下一場戰爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"而只要有戰爭，烏薩斯就能夠運轉起來，國民就能夠齊心協力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_schoolyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尼古拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我認為娜塔莉婭會長說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果是由娜塔莉婭會長來領導我們，我願意服從。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果各位願意信任我，我不介意作為這個團體的組織者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"（雖然勉強制止了鬥爭，但是接下來該怎麼辦呢......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然如此，那我有一個提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"誒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭說得對，我們應該保持貴族應有的體面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕維爾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，就該讓那些平民為我們貢獻一點了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你......難道說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我同意了他們“掠奪平民”的提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭，我曾經認為自己是個善良的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在那個時候，我是這麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我會覺得貴族之間的社交無趣又虛偽，我會為悲劇而哀歎，我甚至為難民們送過飯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不想欺騙你，也不想欺騙我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"在那個時刻，為了團結貴族，我選擇了同意他們的掠奪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“咚”！白髮的女孩被撲倒在地，臉上結結實實挨了幾拳，她的嘴角緩緩淌下鮮紅的血液，而她卻露出笑容。\n這笑容在鮮血的襯托下，顯得如此悲慘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我這個惡魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但你知道嗎，索尼婭，如果沒有和你們的共同生活，沒有來到羅德島，我甚至不會像現在這樣去思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有和你們的共同生活，沒有來到羅德島，我不會像現在這樣去思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是你們教會了我，我並不高貴這個事實，但這個事實本身，才是對我最大的責難。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才會說，如果你找到我的那一天，你如果像殺了我的同伴們一樣殺了我，那該有多好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓我沉溺在自己是個好孩子的幻想中，讓我沉溺在我也是迫不得已的自我安慰中死去，也比現在這樣要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......索尼婭，你看，這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"裁紙刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我在幾個月裡，有26次想要用它割腕，有15次想要用它劃穿自己的喉嚨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......你居然記得這麼仔細。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我每次放棄之後，都會嘲笑自己的愚蠢和膽小，想忘記都很難呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"順便一提，我也考慮過用貴族一點的方法，比如毒茶，用劍自刎，甚至考慮過遺書用什麼格式和字體來寫比較好這樣的蠢事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜這些方法肯定事先就會被其他人發現了，我不太想給其他人添麻煩呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底想說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我對大人們說：我想留在這裡為烏薩斯的人們做些什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我對自己說：娜塔莉婭，你這麼做是在贖罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但是真的是這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"每當我想起尼古拉他們臉上的笑容，想起他們搶劫平民後向我邀功的表情，想起我明明想說這樣不對最後卻對他們報以笑容的懦弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"每當我想起我允許他們的請求，想起我為他們制定計劃告訴他們該怎麼做，想起我對堆積的物資而產生的喜悅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"每當我想起我假裝視而不見的那些慘叫和哭泣，想起我覺得我是被逼無奈我是無辜的，想起我開始習慣那樣的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭，你敢相信嗎？在那場大逃殺中，我沒有殺過一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但我一定是最骯髒的那一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我把你拉過來是想告訴你接下來該怎麼做嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，索尼婭，我不知道，我什麼都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至不知道該怎麼告訴別人我不知道！我只能想到裝出我那副對一切都遊刃有餘的樣子把你拉進來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，抱歉，我有些失態了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要不要喝點什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"紅茶吧，謝謝。"},{"type":"narration","text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你房間的紅茶放在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡各種各樣的茶葉盒子也太多了，我分不清。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"還是我來吧，索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我剛想起來，你應該也不會泡紅茶，因為一時的失態讓你去做了你不擅長的事，真是抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，索尼婭，那天你到底是怎麼想的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"就是火災之後，我四處逃竄最後還是被其他學生抓住時，你為什麼會救下我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明知道我就是前幾天還在學校裡肆虐的貴族們的首領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是你看起來很可憐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那你為什麼會同意我加入自治團？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"因為安娜同意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我恨你嗎，娜塔莉婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道啊，索尼婭，你會恨我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過的混帳從來不承認自己是混帳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但承認自己是混帳的混帳就不是混帳了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......你就這麼想讓我揍你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我可沒有受虐嗜好，只是，該怎麼說好呢。我想對你，嗯，為了防止你誤會，對剛才聽我說了那些話的人坦誠一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"受......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那是貴族之間流傳的一點小小愛好，我也只是有所耳聞，不用在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不過至少，我不想再揍你第二次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"紅茶你是要喝哥倫比亞產的，還是維多利亞產的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......你恢復得真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"隨便，反正我喝不出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟我是被教育成這樣的人呢，無論何時，我都會把最體面的一面展現給別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"要不要糖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，這種紅茶是不能加糖的，請就這麼喝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你好煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著，娜塔莉婭，我不知道該怎麼安慰你，我也不想安慰你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，原來你不止不恨我，還想安慰我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"閉嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好的好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭安慰別人，每次我想這麼做，效果都很糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能告訴你我現在能想到的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才問我，我會不會作為凜冬生活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我的回答是：是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我的爸爸媽媽都死在切爾諾伯格了，所以我不想回那裡，也不想回烏薩斯，就這麼簡單。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我應該能理解你的痛苦或者什麼的，但我不太理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"一開始我以為你只是想要為自己辯解，我見過一些人他們說和你類似的話只是為了趁我分心偷襲我，但你好像真的很難受，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有你，那些貴族雜碎也不會好到哪裡去，又不是你讓貴族變成混蛋的，也不是你讓這一切發生的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"倒不如說是我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒什麼。而且我要是那些貴族之一，可能還會很高興有你這樣的人來當領袖，就好像真理選我當領袖一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得你做了你能做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我討厭你只是因為在加入之前你是我的敵人，而且我不喜歡貴族而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我會做噩夢，做了噩夢我會吐，然後難過得一整晚都睡不著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"但我覺得活下來不是一件壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒覺得讓你活下來是件壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得你是一個混帳，但我知道，沒有你，光靠安娜，我們是沒有辦法在後來的十幾天裡活下來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議你到處走走跑跑，餓了就吃，睏了就睡，比坐著瞎想好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈哈哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你至於笑成這樣嗎，眼淚都出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我只是在想，這就是找你聊天的好處吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是安娜的話，我們兩個現在說著說著可能已經抱頭痛哭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"她也不喜歡你，別忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，噗，哈哈哈，我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，索尼婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"幹什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道嗎，你完全沒有解決我的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我才懶得管你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，我也是沒有辦法解決你的問題的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但有一點你說得對，我們活了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"那你覺得，我們走得出來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"腳下的圓，夜晚，迷宮，內心，思考，深淵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能說通用語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，好吧，那麼，幹員不是都有代號嗎，你覺得我如果成為幹員該取什麼代號？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼知道，我這個代號還是安娜幫我想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那你覺得，Poca怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"露水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"娜塔莉婭","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"對，露水，用通用語的話，就叫早露吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"......還行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那如果我要成為幹員的話，就叫早露好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_013_riop","aliases":["圓規","近衛幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_115_headbr","aliases":["凜冬"]},{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["娜塔莉婭","早露"]}]}
